{'symbol': 'APA', 'date': '2022-09-22 16:36:00', 'title': 'APA CORPORATION ANNOUNCES ENGAGEMENT OF GHD FOR THIRD-PARTY EMISSIONS VERIFICATION', 'text': "HOUSTON, SEPT. 22, 2022 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- APA CORPORATION (NASDAQ: APA) TODAY ANNOUNCED ITS ENGAGEMENT OF GHD, A PRIVATELY-OWNED GLOBAL PROFESSIONAL SERVICES COMPANY SPECIALIZING IN THE IMPLEMENTATION AND VERIFICATION OF SUSTAINABILITY PROJECTS. THIS ENGAGEMENT UNDERPINS APA'S COMMITMENT TO PROTECTING THE ENVIRONMENT, WHICH INCLUDES AN ALL EMPLOYEE COMPENSATION-LINKED GOAL ANNOUNCED EARLIER THIS YEAR TO ELIMINATE AT LEAST 1 MILLION TONNES OF CO2E BY THE END OF 2024."}